The app is built in `src/` and passes `./check` and all 30 visible tests (4 of 15 runs used). `src/App.tsx` default-exports the root, with `IssuesPage.tsx`, `HelpPage.tsx` and `SettingsPage.tsx` beside it, and the state and request logic in `issues.ts`, `help.ts`, `settings.ts` and `util.ts`. Unsure about: the visible run logged one 404 console error on load, which I believe is the favicon, and the brief's assign error text is shown as "assign error: <message>" since it only says the message must include "declined".